    "chunk_text": "\ufffdu \u00feone n\u00e6fre. Ne onfoh \u00f0u n\u00e6fre medsceattum, for\u00f0on hie ablenda\u00f0 ful oft wisra monna ge\u00f0oht & hiora word \u00deam el\u00f0eodegan & utan cumenan ne l\u00e6t \u00f0u no uncu\u00f0lice wi\u00f0 hine, ne mid nanum unryhtum \u00feu hine ne Ne swergen ge n\u00e6fre under h\u00e6\u00f0ne godas, ne on nanum \u00f0ingum ne cleopien ge to him. \u00deis sindan \u00f0a domas \u00fee se \u00e6lmihtega God self sprecende w\u00e6s to Moyse & him bebead to healdanne. & si\u00f0\u00f0an se ancenneda Dryhtnes sunu, ure God, \u00fe\u00e6t is h\u00e6lend Crist, on middangeard cwom, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00d0a \u00e6fter his \u00f0rowunge, \u00e6r \u00feam \u00fee his apostolas tofarene w\u00e6ron geond ealle eor\u00f0an to l\u00e6ranne, & \u00fea \u00dea hie ealle \u00e6tsomne w\u00e6ron, hie sendan \u00e6rendwrecan to Antiohhia & to Syrie, Cristes \u00e6 to l\u00e6ranne. \u00dea hie \u00f0a ongeaton, \u00fe\u00e6t him ne speow, \u00f0a sendon hie \u00e6rendgewrit to him. \u00deis is \u00f0onne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rendgewrit \u00fee \u00f0a apostolas sendon ealle to Antiohhia & to Syria & to cilicia, \u00f0a \u00d0a apostolas & \u00fea eldran bro\u00f0or h\u00e6lo eow wysca\u00f0; & we eow cy\u00f0a\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t we geascodon, \u00fe\u00e6t ure \u00d0a gesomnodon we us ymb \u00f0\u00e6t, & us eallum gelicode \u00f0a, \u00fe\u00e6t we sendon Paulus & Barnaban; \u00f0a Mid him we sendon Iudam & Silam, \u00fe\u00e6t eow \u00fe\u00e6t ilce seccgen. \u00de\u00e6m halgan Gaste w\u00e6s ge\u00f0uht",
